#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of ntp"
msgstr "Instalação do ntp"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There should be a dedicated user and group to take control of the "
"<command>ntpd</command> daemon after it is started. Issue the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Deveria existir um(a) usuário(a) e um grupo dedicado(a) para assumir o "
"controle do processo de segundo plano &quot;<command>ntpd</command>&quot; "
"depois que ele for iniciado. Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:111
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 87 ntp &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Network Time Protocol\" -d /var/lib/ntp -u 87 \\\n"
"        -g ntp -s /bin/false ntp</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 87 ntp &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Protocolo de horário da rede de intercomunicação\" -d /var/lib/ntp -u 87 \\\n"
"        -g ntp -s /bin/false ntp</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid "Fix an type issue by executing"
msgstr "Corrija um problema de tipo executando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:134
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s;pthread_detach(NULL);pthread_detach(0);\" \\\n"
"    -i configure \\\n"
"       sntp/configure</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s;pthread_detach(NULL);pthread_detach(0);\" \\\n"
"    -i configure \\\n"
"       sntp/configure</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>ntp</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>ntp</application>&quot; executando os seguintes"
" comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --bindir=/usr/sbin    \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc     \\\n"
"            --enable-linuxcaps    \\\n"
"            --with-lineeditlibs=readline \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/ntp-&ntp-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --bindir=/usr/sbin    \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc     \\\n"
"            --enable-linuxcaps    \\\n"
"            --with-lineeditlibs=readline \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/ntp-&ntp-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -o ntp -g ntp -d /var/lib/ntp</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -o ntp -g ntp -d /var/lib/ntp</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:168
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--bindir=/usr/sbin</parameter>: This parameter places the "
"administrative programs in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/sbin</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--bindir=/usr/sbin</parameter>: Esse parâmetro coloca os "
"aplicativos administrativos em &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/sbin</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:174
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-linuxcaps</parameter>: ntpd is run as user ntp, so use "
"Linux capabilities for non-root clock control."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-linuxcaps</parameter>: O &quot;ntpd&quot; é executado "
"como usuário(a) &quot;ntp&quot;, de forma que use os recursos do "
"&quot;Linux&quot; para controle de relógio não raiz."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-lineeditlibs=readline</parameter>: This switch enables "
"<application>Readline</application> support for <command>ntpdc</command> and"
" <command>ntpq</command> programs. If omitted, "
"<application>libedit</application> will be used if installed, otherwise no "
"readline capabilities will be compiled."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-lineeditlibs=readline</parameter>: Essa chave habilita o "
"suporte &quot;<application>Readline</application>&quot; para os aplicativos "
"&quot;<command>ntpdc</command>&quot; e &quot;<command>ntpq</command>&quot;. "
"Se omitido, [então] &quot;<application>libedit</application>&quot; será "
"usada se instalada; caso contrário, nenhum recurso do &quot;Readline&quot; "
"será compilado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring ntp"
msgstr "Configurando o ntp"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:195
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>/etc/ntp.conf</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>/etc/ntp.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/ntp.conf"
msgstr "/etc/ntp.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. Third, it defines the location
#.         for the leap-second definition file
#.         <filename>
#. /etc/ntp.leapseconds</filename>, that the
#.         <command>update-leap</command> script checks and updates, when
#.         necessary. This script can be run as a cron job and the
#.         <application>ntp</application> developers recommend a frequency of
#.         about three weeks for the updates.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The following configuration file first defines various ntp servers with open"
" access from different continents. Second, it creates a drift file where "
"<command>ntpd</command> stores the frequency offset and a pid file to store "
"the <command>ntpd</command> process ID.  Since the documentation included "
"with the package is sparse, visit the ntp website at <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.ntp.org/\"/> and <ulink url=\"https://www.ntppool.org/\"/>"
" for more information."
msgstr ""
"O arquivo de configuração a seguir define primeiro vários servidores NTP com"
" acesso aberto a partir de diferentes continentes. Segundo, ele cria um "
"arquivo drift onde <command>ntpd</command> armazena o deslocamento de "
"frequência e um arquivo pid para armazenar o ID do processo "
"<command>ntpd</command>. Como a documentação incluída no pacote é escassa, "
"visite-se o sítio do NTP em <ulink url=\"https://www.ntp.org/\"/> e <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.ntppool.org/\"/> para mais informações."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:224
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/ntp.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Asia\n"
"server 0.asia.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"# Australia\n"
"server 0.oceania.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"# Europe\n"
"server 0.europe.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"# North America\n"
"server 0.north-america.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"# South America\n"
"server 2.south-america.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"driftfile /var/lib/ntp/ntp.drift\n"
"pidfile   /run/ntpd.pid</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/ntp.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Ásia\n"
"server 0.asia.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"# Austrália\n"
"server 0.oceania.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"# Europa\n"
"server 0.europe.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"# América do Norte\n"
"server 0.north-america.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"# América do Sul\n"
"server 2.south-america.pool.ntp.org\n"
"\n"
"driftfile /var/lib/ntp/ntp.drift\n"
"pidfile   /run/ntpd.pid</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You may wish to add a <quote>Security session.</quote> For explanations, see"
" <ulink url= "
"\"https://www.eecis.udel.edu/~mills/ntp/html/accopt.html#restrict\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Você possivelmente deseje adicionar uma <quote>seção de Segurança</quote>. "
"Para explicações, veja-se <ulink url= "
"\"https://www.eecis.udel.edu/~mills/ntp/html/accopt.html#restrict\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:250
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ntp.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Security session\n"
"restrict    default limited kod nomodify notrap nopeer noquery\n"
"restrict -6 default limited kod nomodify notrap nopeer noquery\n"
"\n"
"restrict 127.0.0.1\n"
"restrict ::1</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ntp.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Seção de segurança\n"
"restrict    default limited kod nomodify notrap nopeer noquery\n"
"restrict -6 default limited kod nomodify notrap nopeer noquery\n"
"\n"
"restrict 127.0.0.1\n"
"restrict ::1</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:262
#, xml-text
msgid "Synchronizing the Time"
msgstr "Sincronizando a Hora"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:265
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are two options. Option one is to run <command>ntpd</command> "
"continuously and allow it to synchronize the time in a gradual manner.  The "
"other option is to run <command>ntpd</command> periodically (using cron) and"
" update the time each time <command>ntpd</command> is scheduled."
msgstr ""
"Existem duas opções. A primeira opção é a de executar o "
"&quot;<command>ntpd</command>&quot; continuamente e permitir que ele "
"sincronize a hora de maneira gradual. A outra opção é a de executar o "
"&quot;<command>ntpd</command>&quot; periodicamente (usando o "
"&quot;Cron&quot;) e atualizar a hora cada vez que o "
"&quot;<command>ntpd</command>&quot; estiver agendado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:273
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you choose Option one, then install the <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\"><filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/ntp</filename> init "
"script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\"><filename>ntpd.service</filename> unit</phrase> "
"included in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/> <xref "
"linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/> package."
msgstr ""
"Se você escolher a opção um, então instale <phrase revision=\"sysv\">o "
"conjunto de comandos sequenciais de iniciação "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/ntp</filename>&quot; incluso</phrase> "
"<phrase revision=\"systemd\">a unidade "
"&quot;<filename>ntpd.service</filename>&quot; inclusa</phrase> no pacote "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/>&quot; &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:288
#, xml-text
msgid "ntpd.service"
msgstr "ntpd.service"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:291
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-ntpd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-ntpd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:294
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you prefer to run <command>ntpd</command> periodically, add the following"
" command to <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>'s "
"<filename>crontab</filename>:"
msgstr ""
"Se você preferir executar <command>ntpd</command> periodicamente, adicione o"
" seguinte comando ao <filename>crontab</filename> do(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:299
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<literal>ntpd -q</literal>"
msgstr "<literal>ntpd -q</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:302
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Execute the following command if you would like to set the hardware clock to"
" the current system time at shutdown and reboot:"
msgstr ""
"Execute o seguinte comando se desejar configurar o relógio do "
"&quot;hardware&quot; para a hora atual do sistema no desligamento e "
"reinicialização:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:306
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -v -sf ../init.d/setclock /etc/rc.d/rc0.d/K46setclock &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -v -sf ../init.d/setclock /etc/rc.d/rc6.d/K46setclock</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -v -sf ../init.d/setclock /etc/rc.d/rc0.d/K46setclock &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -v -sf ../init.d/setclock /etc/rc.d/rc6.d/K46setclock</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/ntp.xml:310
#, xml-text
msgid "The other way around is already set up by LFS."
msgstr "O contrário já está configurado pelo LFS."

